OL,3,GNEWSAHonorary degree 'dream come true'
OL,4,Afor conservationist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who set up a wildlife
OL,7,Fconservation charity has said being
OL,8,Fgiven an honorary degree is the
OL,9,F"highlight" of his year.
OL,11,FTullis Matson is among a cohort of
OL,12,Fseven people to be given the award by
OL,13,FShropshire's Harper Adams University as
OL,14,Fpart of its 125th anniversary
OL,15,Fcelebrations.
OL,17,FComedian Ed Byrne and The Archers
OL,18,Factress Felicity Finch are part of the
OL,19,Fgroup receiving their degrees this
OL,20,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
