OL,3,GNEWSAHonorary degree 'dream come true'
OL,4,Afor conservationist
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatson said he was particularly
OL,7,Fthrilled with the award marking his
OL,8,Fachievements as he is "very dyslexic"
OL,9,Fand "left school with no
OL,10,Fqualifications".
